  "name": "Rental Application",
  "description": "Screen tenants online: applicant details, rental history, employment and income, references, occupants, pets and screening consent.",
  "category": "Real Estate",
  "seoTitle": "Free Rental Application Form Template for Landlords",
  "seoDescription": "Rental application form template that collects applicant details, rental history, employer and income, references, occupants, pets and background check consent.",
